{"id": "7e91b2e7-2b08-4f81-9f22-0a36add8814b", "slug": "nexis-compute-enterprise-ai-infrastructure", "title": "Nexis Compute - Enterprise AI Infrastructure", "description": "From early-stage startups to global enterprises, Nexis seamlessly scales your inference workloads with intelligent routing and transparent compute pricing.", "content": "---\nversion: \"alpha\"\nname: \"Nexis Compute - Enterprise AI Infrastructure\"\ndescription: \"From early-stage startups to global enterprises, Nexis seamlessly scales your inference workloads with intelligent routing and transparent compute pricing.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#030108\"\n  secondary: \"#2DD4BF\"\n  tertiary: \"#080410\"\n  neutral: \"#5EEAD4\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.02\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  md: \"12px\"\n  full: \"9999px\"\n---\n\n## Overview\n\nNexis Compute - Enterprise AI Infrastructure uses the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visual tone, spacing rhythm, and interface hierarchy shown in the preview.\n\n## Composition\n\nUse the hero direction \"NEURAL CORE UNRESTRICTED SCALING INFINITE CAPABILITIES\" as the primary mood reference. Keep layout decisions aligned with the rendered HTML, including density, framing, and contrast.\n\n## Colors\n\nUse the extracted color tokens as the palette foundation. Primary actions and focal UI should use the primary token, while neutral, background, and surface tokens should drive structure and contrast.\n\n## Typography\n\nUse Inter for display, body, and label styles unless the generated interface clearly needs a compatible fallback. Maintain strong hierarchy between display text and utility labels.\n\n## Layout\n\nFavor a polished product interface with stable spacing, deliberate content grouping, and no decorative elements that conflict with the attached HTML reference.\n", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Nexis Compute - Enterprise AI Infrastructure</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <style>\n        /* Custom animations for the card border and glare */\n        @keyframes spin { \n            from { transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(0deg); } \n            to { transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(360deg); } \n        }\n        .animate-spin-slow {\n            animation: spin 6s linear infinite;\n        }\n        .glass-reflection {\n            background: linear-gradient(105deg, transparent 15%, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 25%, transparent 35%);\n            background-size: 200% 200%;\n        }\n        \n        /* Subtle pulsing for the beam core */\n        @keyframes energy-flow {\n            0% { opacity: 0.8; transform: translateY(-5%); }\n            50% { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0%); }\n            100% { opacity: 0.8; transform: translateY(-5%); }\n        }\n        .beam-core {\n            animation: energy-flow 2s ease-in-out infinite;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#030108] text-white font-sans antialiased overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-teal-400/40 relative min-h-screen flex flex-col font-light scroll-smooth\">\n    \n    <canvas id=\"particle-canvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none opacity-60 z-0\"></canvas>\n\n    <nav class=\"relative z-20 w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-6 flex justify-between items-center\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:globus-line-duotone\" class=\"text-3xl text-teal-400\"></iconify-icon>\n            <span class=\"text-xl font-normal tracking-tight\">Nexis Compute</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"hidden lg:flex items-center gap-8 bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/5 backdrop-blur-md rounded-full px-8 py-2.5\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm flex items-center gap-2 text-white transition-colors\">\n                <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-400 shadow-[0_0_12px_#2dd4bf]\"></span>\n                Home\n            </a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors\">Platform</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors\">Compute</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors flex items-center gap-1\">\n                Solutions <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-down-linear\"></iconify-icon>\n            </a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors\">Docs</a>\n        </div>\n\n        <button class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-teal-500 to-teal-300 hover:from-teal-400 hover:to-teal-200 text-white px-5 py-2 rounded-md text-sm font-normal transition-all shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(45,212,191,0.5)]\">\n            Deploy Now\n        </button>\n    </nav>\n\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 pt-12 pb-24 flex-1 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-8 items-center\">\n        \n        <div class=\"flex flex-col items-start relative z-20\">\n            <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02] backdrop-blur-sm rounded-full px-3 py-1 mb-8\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cpu-linear\" class=\"text-gray-400\"></iconify-icon>\n                <span class=\"text-xs text-gray-300 uppercase tracking-widest font-normal\">Next-Gen Architecture</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <h1 class=\"text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-extralight tracking-tighter leading-[1.1] text-white\">\n                NEURAL CORE UNRESTRICTED <br />\n                SCALING INFINITE <br />\n                CAPABILITIES\n            </h1>\n\n            <p id=\"reveal-subhead\" class=\"text-base text-gray-400 mt-6 max-w-md leading-relaxed\">\n                From early-stage startups to global enterprises, Nexis seamlessly scales your inference workloads with intelligent routing and transparent compute pricing.\n            </p>\n\n            <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 mt-10\">\n                <button class=\"bg-white text-black hover:bg-gray-200 px-6 py-3 rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors\">\n                    View Architecture\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-teal-500 to-teal-300 hover:from-teal-400 hover:to-teal-200 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-all shadow-[0_0_25px_rgba(45,212,191,0.6)]\">\n                    Start Free Trial\n                </button>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"absolute -bottom-12 left-0 flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-500 cursor-pointer hover:text-white transition-colors hidden lg:flex\">\n                <span class=\"text-xs font-normal\">Scroll Down</span>\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-down-linear\" class=\"text-lg animate-bounce\"></iconify-icon>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"relative w-full h-[600px] lg:h-[800px] flex justify-center items-center mt-12 lg:mt-0 z-10\">\n            \n            <div id=\"energy-beam\" class=\"absolute top-[-25%] left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 h-[80%] w-64 pointer-events-none flex justify-center z-10\" style=\"perspective: 1000px;\">\n                <div class=\"absolute h-full w-full bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-teal-500/10 to-teal-400/0 blur-[40px] mix-blend-screen\"></div>\n                \n                <div class=\"absolute h-full w-24 bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-teal-400/40 to-teal-300/10 blur-[20px] mix-blend-screen\"></div>\n                \n                <div class=\"absolute h-full w-[3px] beam-core bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-white to-white blur-[1px] mix-blend-screen shadow-[0_0_20px_3px_#2dd4bf]\"></div>\n                \n                <div class=\"absolute h-full w-12 flex justify-between opacity-40\">\n                    <div class=\"h-full w-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-teal-200 to-transparent blur-[1px]\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"h-full w-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-teal-200 to-transparent blur-[1px]\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-40 h-10 bg-teal-300 blur-xl opacity-60 mix-blend-screen rounded-[100%]\" style=\"transform: translateY(50%) rotateX(70deg);\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-20 h-4 bg-white blur-md opacity-90 mix-blend-screen rounded-[100%]\" style=\"transform: translateY(50%) rotateX(70deg);\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div id=\"dashboard-card\" class=\"relative w-full max-w-[420px] z-20 mt-32 group\">\n                \n                <div class=\"absolute inset-[-2px] rounded-[1.5rem] overflow-hidden opacity-80\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(45,212,191,0.2);\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 w-[200%] aspect-square bg-[conic-gradient(from_0deg,transparent_0%,transparent_60%,#2dd4bf_80%,#ffffff_100%)] animate-spin-slow\"></div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"relative bg-[#080410]/95 backdrop-blur-3xl rounded-[calc(1.5rem-2px)] p-6 h-full w-full flex flex-col border border-white/[0.08] shadow-[0_20px_50px_-10px_rgba(45,212,191,0.15)] overflow-hidden\">\n                    \n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 glass-reflection pointer-events-none rounded-[calc(1.5rem-2px)] z-0\"></div>\n                    \n                    <div class=\"relative z-10\">\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start mb-6\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                                <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-white/10 to-white/5 border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(25,28,33,0.08)]\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:server-square-linear\" class=\"text-white text-xl\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                                </div>\n                                <div>\n                                    <h3 class=\"text-sm font-medium tracking-tight text-white\">Cluster Nexus-Alpha</h3>\n                                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 mt-0.5\">\n                                        <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-300 animate-pulse shadow-[0_0_10px_#5eead4]\"></span>\n                                        <span class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider font-medium\">Running • US-East</span>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <button class=\"text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors bg-white/5 p-1.5 rounded-lg border border-white/5 shadow-sm\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:menu-dots-linear\" class=\"text-lg\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-6\">\n                            <div class=\"bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-4 transition-all hover:bg-white/[0.05]\">\n                                <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-400 mb-2 font-medium\">GPU Utilization</p>\n                                <div class=\"flex items-end gap-1\">\n                                    <span class=\"text-4xl font-light tracking-tighter text-white\">92</span>\n                                    <span class=\"text-sm text-teal-400 mb-1.5 font-medium\">%</span>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"mt-3 flex items-end gap-1 h-8\">\n                                    <div class=\"w-full bg-white/10 rounded-t-sm h-[40%]\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-full bg-white/10 rounded-t-sm h-[60%]\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-full bg-white/10 rounded-t-sm h-[50%]\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-full bg-white/10 rounded-t-sm h-[80%]\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-full bg-teal-400 rounded-t-sm h-[92%] shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(45,212,191,0.5)]\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-4 transition-all hover:bg-white/[0.05]\">\n                                <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-400 mb-2 font-medium\">Inference Latency</p>\n                                <div class=\"flex items-end gap-1\">\n                                    <span class=\"text-4xl font-light tracking-tighter text-white\">14</span>\n                                    <span class=\"text-sm text-teal-400 mb-1.5 font-medium\">ms</span>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"mt-3 flex items-end gap-1 h-8\">\n                                    <div class=\"w-full bg-white/10 rounded-t-sm h-[30%]\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-full bg-white/10 rounded-t-sm h-[25%]\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-full bg-white/10 rounded-t-sm h-[40%]\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-full bg-white/10 rounded-t-sm h-[20%]\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-full bg-teal-500 rounded-t-sm h-[14%] shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(20,184,166,0.5)]\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"space-y-4 mb-6\">\n                            <div>\n                                <div class=\"flex justify-between text-xs mb-2\">\n                                    <span class=\"text-gray-400 font-medium\">Node Allocation</span>\n                                    <span class=\"text-white font-medium\">8 / 10 Active</span>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"w-full h-2.5 bg-black/40 rounded-full overflow-hidden border border-white/5\">\n                                    <div class=\"h-full bg-gradient-to-r from-teal-600 to-teal-300 w-[80%] rounded-full relative shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(45,212,191,0.3)]\">\n                                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjAiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAiIHhtbG5zPSJodHRwOi8vd3d3LnczLm9yZy8yMDAwL3N2ZyI+PGcgc3Ryb2tlPSIjZmZmIiBzdHJva2Utd2lkdGg9IjEiIG9wYWNpdHk9IjAuMiI+PHBhdGggZD0iTTAgMjBMMjAgMCIvPjwvZz48L3N2Zz4=')] bg-repeat opacity-50\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"pt-4 border-t border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                                <label class=\"relative inline-flex items-center cursor-pointer\">\n                                    <input type=\"checkbox\" checked class=\"sr-only peer\">\n                                    <div class=\"w-9 h-5 bg-white/10 border border-white/20 peer-focus:outline-none rounded-full peer peer-checked:after:translate-x-full peer-checked:after:border-white after:content-[''] after:absolute after:top-[1px] after:left-[2px] after:bg-white after:border-gray-300 after:border after:rounded-full after:h-4 after:w-4 after:transition-all peer-checked:bg-teal-500 shadow-inner\"></div>\n                                </label>\n                                <span class=\"text-xs text-gray-300 font-medium\">Auto-Scale</span>\n                            </div>\n                            <button class=\"bg-white/5 border border-white/10 hover:bg-white/10 text-white text-xs font-medium px-4 py-2 rounded-lg transition-colors shadow-sm\">\n                                Settings\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        // 1. Canvas Particle System for WebGL-like background feel\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('particle-canvas');\n        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n        let width, height;\n        let particles = [];\n\n        function resize() {\n            width = canvas.width = window.innerWidth;\n            height = canvas.height = window.innerHeight;\n        }\n\n        class Particle {\n            constructor() {\n                this.x = Math.random() * width;\n                this.y = Math.random() * height;\n                this.size = Math.random() * 1.5;\n                this.speedY = (Math.random() * 0.5 + 0.1) * -1; // Move up\n                this.opacity = Math.random() * 0.5;\n                this.fadeSpeed = Math.random() * 0.005;\n                this.fadingIn = true;\n                // Hue restricted exclusively to neon turquoise spectrum (approx 170-185)\n                this.hue = Math.floor(Math.random() * (185 - 170) + 170);\n            }\n            update() {\n                this.y += this.speedY;\n                if (this.y < 0) {\n                    this.y = height;\n                    this.x = Math.random() * width;\n                }\n                \n                if (this.fadingIn) {\n                    this.opacity += this.fadeSpeed;\n                    if (this.opacity >= 0.8) this.fadingIn = false;\n                } else {\n                    this.opacity -= this.fadeSpeed;\n                    if (this.opacity <= 0) {\n                        this.fadingIn = true;\n                        this.x = Math.random() * width;\n                        this.y = height;\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            draw() {\n                ctx.fillStyle = `hsla(${this.hue}, 100%, 70%, ${this.opacity})`;\n                ctx.beginPath();\n                ctx.arc(this.x, this.y, this.size, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n                ctx.fill();\n            }\n        }\n\n        function initParticles() {\n            particles = [];\n            const particleCount = window.innerWidth < 768 ? 50 : 150;\n            for (let i = 0; i < particleCount; i++) {\n                particles.push(new Particle());\n            }\n        }\n\n        function animateCanvas() {\n            ctx.clearRect(0, 0, width, height);\n            particles.forEach(p => {\n                p.update();\n                p.draw();\n            });\n            requestAnimationFrame(animateCanvas);\n        }\n\n        window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n            resize();\n            initParticles();\n        });\n        \n        resize();\n        initParticles();\n        animateCanvas();\n\n        // 2. CSS-free Animations for UI elements\n        const card = document.getElementById('dashboard-card');\n        const beam = document.getElementById('energy-beam');\n        let time = 0;\n\n        function animateUI() {\n            time += 0.03;\n            \n            // Smooth float for the dashboard card\n            const floatY = Math.sin(time) * 10;\n            card.style.transform = `translateY(${floatY}px)`;\n            \n            // Pulsing opacity and scale for the energy beam aura to make it feel alive\n            const pulse = (Math.sin(time * 2) + 1) / 2; // 0 to 1\n            const beamOpacity = 0.7 + (pulse * 0.3); // 0.7 to 1.0\n            const beamScale = 0.98 + (pulse * 0.02); // 0.98 to 1.0\n            beam.style.opacity = beamOpacity;\n            beam.style.transform = `translate(-50%, 0) scaleX(${beamScale})`;\n\n            requestAnimationFrame(animateUI);\n        }\n        \n        animateUI();\n\n        // 3. GSAP Masked Staggered Word Reveal\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n            \n            const subhead = document.getElementById('reveal-subhead');\n            if (subhead) {\n                const text = subhead.textContent;\n                subhead.innerHTML = '';\n                \n                // Dynamically wrap text in overflow masks for the stagger effect\n                text.split(' ').forEach(word => {\n                    if (!word.trim()) return;\n                    const wrap = document.createElement('span');\n                    wrap.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                    wrap.style.overflow = 'hidden';\n                    wrap.style.marginRight = '0.25em';\n                    wrap.style.verticalAlign = 'bottom';\n                    \n                    const inner = document.createElement('span');\n                    inner.className = 'gsap-word text-gray-400 block';\n                    inner.textContent = word;\n                    \n                    wrap.appendChild(inner);\n                    subhead.appendChild(wrap);\n                });\n\n                // Apply GSAP reveal animation\n                gsap.fromTo('.gsap-word', \n                    { y: '100%', opacity: 0 },\n                    {\n                        y: '0%',\n                        opacity: 1,\n                        duration: 0.8,\n                        stagger: 0.02,\n                        ease: 'power3.out',\n                        scrollTrigger: {\n                            trigger: subhead,\n                            start: 'top 90%'\n                        }\n                    }\n                );\n            }\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "Nexis-Compute---Enterprise-AI-Infrastructure.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/nexis-compute-enterprise-ai-infrastructure.jpg", "source_name": "Nexis-Compute---Enterprise-AI-Infrastructure-DESIGN.md", "views": 104, "forks": 6, "private": false, "featured": false, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-04-29T00:44:46.434433+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T23:45:54.67952+00:00"}